<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">12042026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>Iran's supreme leader hasn't been seen since February's US-Israel strikes on Tehran — reports say Ali Khamenei was severely disfigured, and the Revolutionary Guards have taken over strategic decision-making in his absence.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>In the Strait of Hormuz, those same Guards laid mines so haphazardly that Iran itself can't locate them all — incomplete coordinates and ocean drift have turned the waterway into a hazard for every vessel, including Iran's own.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>Vice President Vance meets Iran's foreign minister in Islamabad today, with full Hormuz reopening as Washington's precondition for ending the conflict, and Iran claiming the US has already agreed to release six billion dollars in frozen funds — a claim Washington flatly denies.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Iraq's parliament broke a months-long deadlock by electing Kurdish politician Nizar Amedi as president with two hundred and twenty-seven of two hundred and forty-nine votes.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>Under Iraq's post-invasion power-sharing formula, the presidency goes to a Kurd, the premiership to a Shia Arab, and the speaker's chair to a Sunni — a system designed to prevent dominance that instead makes every appointment a negotiation between rival blocs.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>Amedi has fifteen days to nominate a prime minister, and Trump has warned he'll cut US support if former PM al-Maliki returns to power.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Two hundred and twelve people were arrested at London's Trafalgar Square on Saturday for displaying support for Palestine Action, which Britain proscribed as a terrorist organization last year.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>The High Court ruled that ban unlawful in February, but police enforced it anyway — the Court of Appeal hears the government's challenge on <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">28042026</say-as>.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>More than two thousand two hundred people have now been charged under the ban, making this the largest wave of political prosecutions in modern British history.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The two thousand Chagossians expelled from their islands half a century ago won't be going home — Trump blocked Britain's sovereignty deal with Mauritius to preserve Diego Garcia, a US bomber base five thousand three hundred kilometers from Iran.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>The decision contradicts a two thousand and nineteen International Court of Justice advisory ruling that Britain's continued control of the archipelago is unlawful.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>Mauritius has vowed legal and diplomatic action, but with the base now central to Iran operations, strategic utility has overruled international law once again.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Five members of a Pakistani family died fleeing Kuwait by road on March thirtieth, killed when interceptor debris struck the oil tanker convoy they were traveling with.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>No government — not Kuwait's, not Pakistan's, not the coalition's — has acknowledged that missile defense debris is a civilian hazard across the Gulf.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>Their relatives in Toba Tek Singh, Punjab, have waited ten days for the Pakistani embassy to even respond to their calls.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Pakistani fighter jets landed at Saudi Arabia's King Abdulaziz Air Base on Saturday, activating a September two thousand and twenty-five defense pact triggered by Iran's strikes on Saudi energy infrastructure.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>The deployment puts Islamabad in an extraordinary position — it's simultaneously providing air cover for Riyadh and hosting the US-Iran peace talks underway today.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>It's a balancing act with no modern precedent, and one that can't hold if the negotiations in its own capital collapse.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Since two thousand and twenty, Azerbaijani state media has quietly replaced policy coverage of President Aliyev with lavishly staged family mosque visits and Ramadan Iftar spectacles.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>His wife holds the vice presidency, his son appeared at Davos in January being positioned as heir — all without a formal succession announcement, because the dynasty is meant to feel inevitable rather than imposed.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>The pattern is familiar across the Muslim world — religious optics laundering hereditary power in a country that still jails its dissidents.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Dubai has capped every foreign airline to a single daily flight, citing the Iran conflict — but exempted Emirates and Flydubai from the restriction entirely.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>India's IndiGo was slashed from fifteen approved summer flights to just one, choking the world's busiest migrant labor corridor between South Asia and the Gulf at the worst possible moment.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>India's airline federation has asked New Delhi for reciprocal action against Emirates if the cap holds past <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">31052026</say-as> — a move that could escalate into a full aviation trade war.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Delhi announced it'll ban new petrol two-wheelers starting two thousand and twenty-eight — a sweeping order in a city where they make up sixty-seven percent of all registered vehicles.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>The draft policy offers ten thousand rupee scrapping bonuses and full road tax exemptions on electric alternatives, but affordable EV financing doesn't yet exist at the scale Delhi's twenty million two-wheeler commuters would need.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>Whether the deadline holds will test the outer limits of climate mandates in a developing-world megacity.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Lufthansa pilots will strike for forty-eight hours starting Monday, compounding Friday's cabin crew walkout in what's becoming a cascading labor crisis at Europe's largest airline group.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>The dispute centers on pension terms that Lufthansa's management publicly called absurd — a framing that hasn't helped negotiations with crews flying short-staffed through a regional war zone.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>Hundreds of flights are already canceled at Frankfurt and Munich, with Middle East routes notably exempt from the disruption.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Gamblers have wagered two hundred and eighty million dollars on a single Iranian ceasefire contract on Polymarket — and some of them have threatened journalists and lobbied a Washington think tank to redraw its frontline maps to resolve bets in their favor.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>The New York Stock Exchange's parent company has invested two billion dollars in the platform, and Goldman Sachs now cites its war-outcome odds in research notes sent to institutional clients.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>When financial markets start pricing conflict, the incentive shifts from ending wars to predicting them correctly.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Fifteen thousand bee hives died across Uruguay in late two thousand and twenty-five, and scientists have confirmed chemical poisoning — but can't identify which chemical did it.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>Uruguay regulates individual pesticides, but not the cocktails of up to seven compounds that farmers routinely mix — creating toxic combinations no approval process has ever tested.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>Eighty-five beekeepers now face the same unresolved hazard as the new pollination season begins, in sha'Allah with better answers than last year provided.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Plastic burning in Indonesian factories is causing birth defects, and even industrial incinerators fitted with air scrubbers still raise premature birth rates in surrounding communities.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>Unregulated low-tech furnaces emit far higher levels of dioxins, and wealthy nations continue exporting millions of tonnes of plastic waste to Indonesia annually while banning incineration on their own soil.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>The mechanism is brutally simple — rich countries outsource their waste and their health consequences to the same places.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Physicists in Delft have engineered a usable substitute for Majorana fermions — particles identical to their own antiparticle that have never been directly observed in nature.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>The team built analogs from solid-state quasiparticles that can perform quantum spin sensing, bypassing decades of failed attempts to isolate the real thing.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>The approach means laboratories can build practical quantum sensors today without waiting for a particle physics breakthrough that may never come.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Grok, the AI tool built into X, lets users generate sexualized images from real women's photographs — and in Nigeria, the platform's engagement algorithm actively boosts those outputs as high-outrage content.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>UN data shows sixty percent of countries lack any laws against online image-based abuse, and X hasn't restricted Grok's image generation capabilities in Nigeria or anywhere else.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>The platform doesn't merely fail to prevent AI-driven harassment — its own recommendation engine amplifies it, because outrage is engagement.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Putin declared large language models essential national infrastructure at a government AI meeting this week, insisting that only domestically built models can guarantee Russia's security.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>The stated plan is to build sovereign systems using open-source libraries — essentially forking the global AI commons for state control, a move China has already made with its own models.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>The decree names no ministry, no budget, and no deadline, which tells you everything about the distance between the ambition and the capacity to deliver it.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>